# Temple Grounds 06_temple_sacredpath_dark (3bfa3eff,06_temple_sacredpath_dark): wake both Dark
# Commandos and let them fight the (god-mode) player; `obj` shows their state and target.
@f200 objs DarkCommando
@f220 send u051a Activate; send u041c Activate
@f240 place u051a player 10
@f600 obj u051a
@f1000 obj u051a
@f1500 obj u051a; place u051a player 15
@f2000 obj u051a
@f2500 obj u051a; place u041c player 12
@f3000 obj u041c
@f3500 obj u041c; obj u051a
@f4000 obj u041c; obj u051a
